"This file stores the users toolbar settings and the menu structure. Tip: "
"read also the <link linkend=\"faqi_missing_menus\">krusaderui.rc &FAQ;</"
"link>."
msgstr ""
"Ova datoteka sprema korisnikove postavke alatne trake i meni strukture. "
